        "exam_code": "OSG202_SU26_FE_HN",
        "content": "A system has 10 units of a single resource. There are three processes: P1, P2, and P3. At a certain moment, their maximum needed and allocated units are:Process MaximumNeeded AllocatedP1 6 3P2 5 4P3 7 3What is the state of the system?",
